				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5083</guid>
				<title>Earbuds</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5083</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; it must be put in a glass case and make sure that its in a warm environment. whatever you do, DO NOT PUT THEM IN YOUR EARS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; There are 2 red and grey plastic ear buds with a long wire attached to the ground. Not much else is known about the headphones other than they are dangerous, we know this because we tested it in the research sector, we put it on a tester. And as soon as we put the earbuds on the tester. he was gone. We assume that the tester is in another plane.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrstrangest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6952905&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607112301&quot; alt=&quot;MrStrangest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6952905)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrstrangest&quot;  &gt;MrStrangest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
