&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;𝔩𝐎ØⓀ 𝓲ή Δ м𝕚𝐑Ｒ𝓸г&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;
- &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607112304&quot; alt=&quot;JackalRelated&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated&quot;  &gt;JackalRelated&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; upon being asked to insult me, apparently summing&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-339545-7&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Cthulhu&lt;/p&gt;
