&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Hey you little piss baby, you think you&#039;re so fucking cool, huh? You think you&#039;re so fucking tough? You talk a lot of ~big game~ for someone with such a ~small truck~&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;
- &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2951719&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607112304&quot; alt=&quot;Tyumen&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2951719)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen&quot;  &gt;Tyumen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
