				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Object Class: Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Special Containment Procedures: SCP-5138 is to be guarded by armed guards at all times. No personnel with less than Level 3 Clearance may enter SCP-5138 under any circumstances unless under testing Purposes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description: SCP-5138 appears as a small grove of Japanese White Birch (Betula Platyphylla) In REDACTED, Scotland. Item appears always in autumnal colours and sheds a seemingly infinite ammount of leaves. Walking down the grove will lead to a bamboo archway, which, when entered transports individuals to a traditional japanese garden, hereby referred to as SCP-5138-1. The garden has been reported to evoke feelings of peace in all cases. upon exiting through the archway subjects have reported being transported to a similar grove tho the one aforementioned, the only difference being that this one stretches on indefininetly. This grove is known as SCP-5138-2. Returning to SCP-5138-1 is now impossible due to the archways dissapearance. All subjects confined in SCP-5138-2 for more more than 20 minutes have reported seeing a figure in the trees, the figure has been designated SCCP-5138-Alpha. SCp-5138-Alpha is sentient and extremely hostile. upon sighting any humans within SCP-5138-2, SCP-5138-Alpha will proceed to skewer the eyes of the subject and impale thier corpse on a branch of a tree in SCP-5138-Alpha. SCP-5138-Alpha is approximately 2.8 meters tall and weighs 250 kilograms. Subjects skin is identical to the bark of the trees in the grove. SCP-5138-Alpha also has hair resesmbling common tree lichen. SCP-5138-Alpha can be goaded to attack earlier than the time specified above by attemting to cause damage to the tree. SCP-5138 has also proven almost immune to nearly all forms of attack, examples include; blunt force trauma, laceration, and even standard assault rifle fire. SCP-5138-Alpha has never been sighted outside SCP-5138-2, this may suggest that he is a gaurd to the grove rather than a malevolent entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentgat0r&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6980291&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607112306&quot; alt=&quot;AgentGat0r&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6980291)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentgat0r&quot;  &gt;AgentGat0r&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
