her than a malevolent entity.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentgat0r" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6980291&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607112306" alt="AgentGat0r" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6980291)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentgat0r" >AgentGat0r</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
