						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-jp-sandbox3.wdfiles.com/local--code/credit%3Abackmodule/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Info</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/grigori-karpin-s-author-page">More by this author</a></strong></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="en cdver2" style="width: 100%;height: 0;padding-bottom: calc(50% / 3);background-position: center; background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22600%22%20height%3D%22100%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20100%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cstyle%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3Erect%5Bfill*%3D%22b01%22%5D%20%7Banimation%3A%20b