rated +60 or higher, and at least 1 artwork page rated +70 or higher.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/10.png" alt="10.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">010</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Rising from the ashes</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><em>Rewrite</em> an SCP/tale/GOI-format two times or more, the final version rated +70 or higher.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/11.png" alt="11.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">011</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Caught in a self-set trap</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">Let one or more <em>foundation-made</em> anomaly cause K-Class Scenarios in at least 3 SCPs/tales.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/12.png" alt="12.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">012</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Lost in a Paradox</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">Author of at least one SCP/tale/GOI-format which involves ethics-committee-related content. Containing a scene where the committee is facing a dilemma. Rated +40 or higher.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/13.png" alt="13.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">013</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Smriti</str