x solid #888;">Author of a SPC-related SCP/tale/GOI-format. Containing bombing/explosion-related content and rated +40 or higher.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/21.png" alt="21.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">021</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Broken but complete</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">Author of a <em>broken</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-300609-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> SCP/tale/GOI-format related to <em>The Church of the Broken God</em>. Rated +40 or higher.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/22.png" alt="22.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">022</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Flag holder</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">Author of at least 100 articles (SCPs/tales/GOI-formats/artworks/hubs/essays/guides). All rated +40 or higher.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/23.png" alt="23.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">023</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; border: 1px solid #888;"><strong>Heroes in despair</strong></td> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">Let other GOI(s) save the world when the Foundation has fallen.</td> <td style="padding: 0 2px; text-align: center;border: 1px solid #888;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/achievement-badges/05.png" alt="05.png" class="image" /></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="padding: 0 2px;border: 1px solid #888;">024<