&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-654004-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. A minyan is a gathering of at least ten of-age Jewish individuals. Some prayers are traditionally not said without a minyan present.&lt;/div&gt;
