&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-654004-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Hebrew for &amp;quot;saving a life&amp;quot;. Commonly refers to the Jewish principle of prioritizing sanctity of life over almost all other religious restrictions.&lt;/div&gt;
